<title>USA: Cyclone Rhonda weakens rapidly in Indian Ocean-WSC.</title>
<headline>Cyclone Rhonda weakens rapidly in Indian Ocean-WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical cyclone Rhonda is becoming less of a threat to shipping in the southeast Indian Ocean as it weakens rapidly, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Friday.</p>
<p>It is expected to dissipate before it reaches the West Australia coast in less than 36 hours. It could cause locally strong winds and heavy rains as it moves inland.</p>
